WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,560
The teacher said that when our mecha comes down, he will take us apart first.

2
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,360
Then it can be modified and installed.

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,360
I'm waiting for this day to be easy to do

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,520
Shouldn’t the rare mecha be put on for urban combat as soon as possible?

5
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,130
Wearing a mecha for the first time

6
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:23,450
Please be sure to be accompanied by your instructor

7
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,090
You cannot rent the mecha after you get it.

8
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:27,450
Resale, splitting and reselling its parts, etc.

9
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:30,210
If the mecha is damaged or lost, please handle it yourself.

10
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:33,610
The school is not responsible for reissues and it is strictly prohibited to fly mechas beyond the level.

11
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:36,250
All the mecha people come to me to get their mechas.

12
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,850
Don't leave after you get it

13
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:41,050
Let’s go to a special venue later to practice piloting mechas together.

14
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:43,410
Those who dye materials must reach the sober mecha
